Register the "checkpoint" plugin type with NCCL's generic plugin loader, so
src/plugin/checkpoint.cc can resolve the library named by
$NCCL_CHECKPOINT_PLUGIN through the same machinery as net/tuner/profiler
plugins.

Apply from the NCCL source root:

    git apply /path/to/GPU-CR/adapters/nccl/nccl_patches/plugin_loader.patch

Generated against upstream v2.30.4-1; the hunks are small and apply with
fuzz on nearby versions.

